cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite both the thesis and the dataset."
title: "Automated Essay Grading with Fine-Tuned Gemma 2 9B-IT"
abstract: >-
  Code and analysis for an automated grading system for business education
  essay questions, built on Gemma 2 9B-IT fine-tuned with LoRA. Student
  responses are scored against a four-criterion rubric (Clarity, Terminology,
  Coverage, Accuracy) on a 0-5 scale, with agreement measured against human
  expert examiners.
type: software
